<scenario name="Deregulation, 1982" startYear="1982" startCash="9000000" difficulty="Hard" endYear="1990">
  <intro
    text="The Bus Regulatory Reform Act has just passed. For fifty years the route you ran and the fare you charged were the government's business; from this year they are yours. Anybody can open a route, anybody can undercut you, and the thin country runs you were obliged to keep are yours to drop. Your carrier is small, your coaches are old, and the two national lines are about to find out what competition feels like. Build something that is still standing in 1990." />
  <success
    text="You came through deregulation with your carrier intact and your books in order, which is more than Greyhound and Trailways between them managed." />
  <start carrier="BT" homeBase="OMA" debt="3000000">
    <routes>
      <route departure="OMA" destination="CHI" coach="MCI MC-9 Crusader II" quantity="2" />
